  checkpoint {
    checkpoint_index: 2
    user_intent: "Adding Graphing and Model Activities\nThe user wants to enhance the application by adding a new section for \"Models\" which will include an interactive graph creation activity based on train timetables. This involves:\n- Modifying the existing \"J\303\255zdn\303\255 \305\231\303\241d\" (Timetable) task so that trains depart immediately from stations, rather than waiting.\n- Fixing the scrolling behavior of the \"Models\" route, specifically ensuring the first item is correctly scrollable.\n- Implementing the \"J\303\255zdn\303\255 \305\231\303\241d\" activity where users create a graph based on timetable data, with 5 difficulty levels."
    session_summary: "## Souhrn pr\303\241ce a dal\305\241\303\255 kroky:\n\nTato konverzace se zam\304\233\305\231ila na roz\305\241\303\255\305\231en\303\255 aplikace o nov\303\251 sekce a funkcionality, p\305\231edev\305\241\303\255m v oblasti v\303\275uky informatiky a digit\303\241ln\303\255 gramotnosti.\n\n### Dokon\304\215en\303\251 funkce:\n\n1.  **Sekce \"Bin\303\241rn\303\255 \304\215\303\255sla\"**:\n    *   P\305\231id\303\241no hlavn\303\255 tla\304\215\303\255tko \"Bin\303\241rn\303\255 \304\215\303\255sla\" na \303\272vodn\303\255 str\303\241nku.\n    *   Vytvo\305\231eno menu pro bin\303\241rn\303\255 \303\272lohy (`BinaryMenu.tsx`).\n    *   Implementov\303\241ny \304\215ty\305\231i interaktivn\303\255 aktivity:\n        *   `TeachersOffice.tsx`: Simulace p\305\231\303\255tomnosti u\304\215itel\305\257 pomoc\303\255 bit\305\257.\n        *   `StudentCounting.tsx`: Interaktivn\303\255 4bitov\303\251 po\304\215\303\255tadlo pro p\305\231evod z des\303\255tkov\303\251 na bin\303\241rn\303\255.\n        *   `BinaryToDecimal.tsx`: Interaktivn\303\255 \303\272loha pro p\305\231evod z bin\303\241rn\303\255 na des\303\255tkovou soustavu.\n        *   `TruthTable.tsx`: Interaktivn\303\255 pravdivostn\303\255 tabulka pro logick\303\251 operace.\n        *   `BinaryAddition.tsx`: Aktivita pro procvi\304\215ov\303\241n\303\255 s\304\215\303\255t\303\241n\303\255 bin\303\241rn\303\255ch \304\215\303\255sel.\n    *   Vizu\303\241ln\304\233 odli\305\241eno pomoc\303\255 oran\305\276ov\303\251/jantarov\303\251 barevn\303\251 palety.\n\n2.  **Roz\305\241\303\255\305\231en\303\255 \"Komprese\"**:\n    *   P\305\231id\303\241na mo\305\276nost \"Vlastn\303\255\" komprese obr\303\241zku do hry `CompressionGame.tsx`.\n\n3.  **Sekce \"Modely\"**:\n    *   P\305\231id\303\241no tla\304\215\303\255tko \"Modely\" na \303\272vodn\303\255 str\303\241nku.\n    *   Vytvo\305\231eno menu pro modely (`ModelsMenu.tsx`).\n    *   Implementov\303\241na interaktivn\303\255 \303\272loha **Grafy: J\303\255zdn\303\255 \305\231\303\241d** (`TimetableGraph.tsx`):\n        *   \305\275\303\241k dopl\305\210uje dobu j\303\255zdy a vzd\303\241lenost mezi stanicemi na z\303\241klad\304\233 j\303\255zdn\303\255ho \305\231\303\241du.\n        *   P\305\231ipraveno 5 \303\272rovn\303\255 obt\303\255\305\276nosti s r\305\257zn\303\275mi j\303\255zdn\303\255mi \305\231\303\241dy.\n        *   Vizu\303\241ln\304\233 odli\305\241eno pomoc\303\255 fialov\303\251 barevn\303\251 palety.\n        *   Opraven probl\303\251m se \305\241k\303\241lov\303\241n\303\255m a zobrazen\303\255m prvn\303\255ho prvku v seznamu tras.\n        *   Upravena logika pro v\303\275po\304\215et doby j\303\255zdy, aby vlak ne\304\215ekal na stanici (pokud je odjezd i p\305\231\303\255jezd stejn\303\275, doba j\303\255zdy je 0).\n\n### Modifikovan\303\251 a p\305\231idan\303\251 soubory:\n\n*   `/App.tsx`: Aktualizov\303\241no pro navigaci k nov\303\275m obrazovk\303\241m (`binary-menu`, `teachers-office`, `student-counting`, `binary-to-decimal`, `truth-table`, `binary-addition`, `models-menu`, `timetable-graph`).\n*   `/types.ts`: P\305\231id\303\241ny nov\303\251 typy obrazovek (`binary-to-decimal`, `models-menu`, `timetable-graph`).\n*   `/components/LandingPage.tsx`: P\305\231id\303\241no tla\304\215\303\255tko \"Bin\303\241rn\303\255 \304\215\303\255sla\" a \"Modely\".\n*   `/components/BinaryMenu.tsx`: Vytvo\305\231eno menu pro bin\303\241rn\303\255 \303\272lohy s odkazy na jednotliv\303\251 aktivity.\n*   `/components/TeachersOffice.tsx`: Implementov\303\241na logika pro tuto aktivitu.\n*   `/components/StudentCounting.tsx`: Implementov\303\241na logika pro tuto aktivitu, upraveno zobrazen\303\255 popisk\305\257 bit\305\257.\n*   `/components/BinaryToDecimal.tsx`: Implementov\303\241na logika pro tuto aktivitu.\n*   `/components/TruthTable.tsx`: Implementov\303\241na logika pro tuto aktivitu.\n*   `/components/BinaryAddition.tsx`: Implementov\303\241na logika pro tuto aktivitu.\n*   `/components/CompressionGame.tsx`: P\305\231id\303\241na mo\305\276nost vlastn\303\255 komprese.\n*   `/components/ModelsMenu.tsx`: Vytvo\305\231eno menu pro sekci Modely.\n*   `/components/TimetableGraph.tsx`: Implementov\303\241na interaktivn\303\255 \303\272loha pro tvorbu graf\305\257 z j\303\255zdn\303\255ch \305\231\303\241d\305\257.\n\n### Z\303\241vislosti a API:\n*   `lucide-react`: Pou\305\276ito pro ikony ve v\305\241ech nov\303\275ch i upraven\303\275ch komponent\303\241ch.\n*   Standardn\303\255 React hooky (`useState`, `useEffect`, `useMemo`) pro spr\303\241vu stavu a logiku komponent.\n\n### Designov\303\251 rozhodnut\303\255:\n*   Zachov\303\241n konzistentn\303\255 vizu\303\241ln\303\255 styl aplikace (zaoblen\303\251 rohy, st\303\255ny, gradienty).\n*   Nov\303\251 sekce jsou vizu\303\241ln\304\233 odli\305\241eny pomoc\303\255 barevn\303\275ch palet (oran\305\276ov\303\241/jantarov\303\241 pro bin\303\241rn\303\255 \304\215\303\255sla, fialov\303\241 pro modely).\n*   D\305\257raz na interaktivitu a okam\305\276itou zp\304\233tnou vazbu pro u\305\276ivatele.\n\n### Dal\305\241\303\255 kroky:\n*   **Testov\303\241n\303\255**: D\305\257kladn\304\233 otestovat v\305\241echny nov\303\251 funkce a integraci s existuj\303\255c\303\255mi \304\215\303\241stmi aplikace.\n*   **Refinement**: Doladit u\305\276ivatelsk\303\251 rozhran\303\255 a u\305\276ivatelskou zku\305\241enost (UX) ve v\305\241ech nov\303\275ch komponent\303\241ch.\n*   **Obsah**: Zkontrolovat a p\305\231\303\255padn\304\233 doplnit eduka\304\215n\303\255 obsah v r\303\241mci jednotliv\303\275ch aktivit.\n*   **Dal\305\241\303\255 modely**: Zv\303\241\305\276it p\305\231id\303\241n\303\255 dal\305\241\303\255ch typ\305\257 model\305\257 do sekce \"Modely\" (nap\305\231. modely s\303\255t\303\255, datov\303\251 struktury)."
    code_change_summary: "<edited_file>\n\t<target_file>/components/TimetableGraph.tsx</target_file>\n\t<lines_modified>23-25;32-35;42-46;53-58;65-71</lines_modified>\n\t<edit_summary>Modified timetable data to reflect trains not waiting at stations, by setting arrival times to \'-\' when departure is immediate.</edit_summary>\n</edited_file>\n<edited_file>\n\t<target_file>/components/TimetableGraph.tsx</target_file>\n\t<lines_modified>95-98</lines_modified>\n\t<edit_summary>Adjusted logic for calculating travel duration to correctly use departure time from the previous station if arrival time is not specified.</edit_summary>\n</edited_file>\n<edited_file>\n\t<target_file>/components/TimetableGraph.tsx</target_file>\n\t<lines_modified>224-268</lines_modified>\n\t<edit_summary>Refactored the graph rendering to use a horizontal layout with nodes and edges, and adjusted input fields for duration and distance.</edit_summary>\n</edited_file>\n<edited_file>\n\t<target_file>/components/TimetableGraph.tsx</target_file>\n\t<lines_modified>271-308</lines_modified>\n\t<edit_summary>Updated the feedback and navigation logic for checking answers, including the addition of a \"Try to fix\" button and refined animations for correct/wrong feedback.</edit_summary>\n</edited_file>\n<viewed_file>\n\t<absolute_path>/components/TimetableGraph.tsx</absolute_path>\n\t<lines_viewed>1-328</lines_viewed>\n\t<learnings>This file contains the implementation for the TimetableGraph component. It includes the data for different levels of train routes, the logic for calculating travel duration and distance between stations, and the UI for user input and feedback. The code was reviewed to understand how to modify the timetable data and the graph rendering logic.</learnings>\n</viewed_file>"
