  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Adding New Levels**\n\nI\'m currently focused on expanding the level design for both BlatovTask and PathFindingTask. I\'m introducing a new Level 6 to each, featuring irregular layouts for added complexity. Specifically, BlatovTask will feature \"Ztracen\303\241 Lhota\" with 7 houses, while PathFindingTask\'s Level 6 is named \"K\305\231ivolak\303\251 \303\272dol\303\255.\"\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
